Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: T1 Keyboard Config contributors <t1kb@example.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Recommends: pipewire-utils
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: T1 mini keyboard configurator for Linux
 Configuration tool for the T1 mini keyboard (USB VID 1189 / PID 8890):
 key remapping, modifier combos, media / mouse / LED actions, layer
 switching, dial volume control and VRChat OSC bindings.
 .
 The tool talks to the device configuration interface through usbfs and
 installs a udev rule scoped to this vendor / product pair, so no group
 membership or re-login is required.
